sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T1 as Thread 1
    participant M as counter (shared)
    participant T2 as Thread 2
    Note over T1,T2: WITHOUT the lock — counter += 1 is read, add, write
    T1->>M: read counter → 41
    T2->>M: read counter → 41
    T1->>M: write 42
    T2->>M: write 42
    Note over T1,T2: two increments happened, the value rose by ONE — a lost update
    Note over T1,T2: WITH `with lock:` — the three steps become one unit
    T1->>M: acquire lock
    T1->>M: read 42, add, write 43
    T1->>M: release lock
    T2->>M: acquire lock (waited here)
    T2->>M: read 43, add, write 44
    T2->>M: release lock
